stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> queued : enqueue, decision allows
    [*] --> held_quiet_hours : inside quiet hours
    [*] --> skipped_disabled : audience or rule off
    [*] --> skipped_opt_out : patient opted out
    [*] --> failed : no address for the channel
    held_quiet_hours --> queued : relay claims it once the window ends
    queued --> sent : provider accepted
    queued --> queued : send failed, retry with backoff
    queued --> failed : permanent error or 5th attempt
    sent --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    skipped_disabled --> [*]
    skipped_opt_out --> [*]
